# ── Secrets / credentials — NEVER track ────────────────────────────────────
secrets.env
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.token
credentials*

# ── Personal config (real residences / protected-people names) ─────────────
loupe-settings.json

# ── iCloud auth session cookie (Connect 2a) — NEVER track ──────────────────
icloud-session/

# ── Runtime data stores (decisions, vault, pairs, summaries, faces, enrichment)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Caches / logs / editor backups ─────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
logs/
cache/
enrich-import-staging/
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak*

# ── Virtualenvs & model weights (large, reproducible) ──────────────────────
.faces-venv/
.venv/
venv/
.insightface/

# ── Originals / media (never track; originals live on the NAS) ─────────────
*.heic
*.heif
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
# favicon raster set — derived from static/favicon.svg, committed so a fresh clone
# renders correctly with no build step (avoids a cairosvg/Cairo dependency at setup)
!static/icons/*.png
*.mov
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.gif
*.tiff

# Superseded / archived code bundles
*.tgz

# Generated work-list artifacts (contain real media paths / GPS / filenames — regenerated
# by triage_and_repull.py / quarantine_probe.py; kept on disk, never published)
*.csv
icloud-repull-list.md
quarantine-unreadable-videos.md
vault/
run-status/
graphify-out/
# Agent working dir (Claude Code) — local only, never publish
.claude/

# Stage5 embeddings feature — model weights / query venv / export dir (large, reproducible)
stage5/models/
.stage5-query-venv/
video-faces-export/

# Forensic snapshot retained from the 2026-07-09 orphan-row cleanup. 36MB SQLite holding
# 65,700 assets rows from the retired ~/loupe/metadata.db (that DB is gone; its orphaned
# -shm/-wal remain). Deliberately NOT deleted: ~130 rows carry values the live
# ~/loupe-pipeline/metadata.db lacks (104 processing_errors + scattered EXIF/GPS/dimensions),
# and 6,666 rows disagree on is_live_photo_still/is_live_photo_video. Live is otherwise the
# better copy. Full analysis: homelab-vault/sessions/2026-08-03-delta-wifi-syncthing-rescan-heartbeat-churn.md
archive-pre-delete/

# aesthetic/ — blind A/B aesthetic-preference experiment, relocated from
# delta:~/aesthetic 2026-08-07. Source is tracked; the heavy and runtime
# artifacts are not. pairs.npz alone is 202 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit.
aesthetic/venv/
aesthetic/**/__pycache__/
aesthetic/pairs.npz
aesthetic/split.npz
aesthetic/preferences.db
aesthetic/preferences.db-shm
aesthetic/preferences.db-wal
aesthetic/aesthetic_head.pt
aesthetic/aesthetic_head.onnx.data
aesthetic/eyeball/*.html
aesthetic/zeroshot/*.html
